    "intro": "A volunteer handed out the medal boxes in the wrong order, and the scoreboard went dark an hour ago.\nFive athletes are involved. Determine each athlete's placing, event, jersey and hometown.\n- **Athlete**: Diego Vasquez, Camille Boyd, Ingrid Solheim, Tobias Pike and Rashad Ellery.\n- **Placing** (listed from better to worse): first, second, third, fourth and fifth.\n- **Event**: the 400 meter hurdles, the 100 meter dash, the pole vault, the triple jump and the high jump.\n- **Jersey**: a coral jersey, a navy jersey, a silver jersey, a teal jersey and a maroon jersey.\n- **Hometown**: Walla Walla, Fargo, Boca Raton, Flagstaff and Shreveport.\nEvery athlete has a different placing, event, jersey and hometown, so within each category every item is used exactly once.",
